'Dry Paint misses four appearance targets: mid-tone share, mean opacity, streak count and repeat peak. Its requested lower load, 0.9 stroke opacity and 0.25 wash deliberately yield lighter paint; they have not been silently raised to force an opaque-ink score. Too many separate lanes and small coherent recurrences remain. Both presets fail the requested opacity speed delta and extra-streak-on-bends target; Ink also fails the fray speed delta. The dynamics are present, but not strong enough by these measures.','',
